Package: forestdiameterdistribution
Type: Project
Title: Diameter Distribution Modelling for Tropical Forest Inventory Data
Version: 0.1.0
Author: Oyediran Abiodun
Description: Fits 12 candidate probability distributions to tree diameter at
    breast height (DBH) data by maximum likelihood and ranks them with
    Kolmogorov-Smirnov, Anderson-Darling and Cramer-von Mises statistics.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Depends: R (>= 4.0.0)
Imports: fitdistrplus, goftest
